## Input

```css
.form-control > select {
	@-moz-document url-prefix() {
		--padding-inline-start: var(--inset-base);
		color: red;

		> option {
			color: blue;
		}
	}
}

div {
	@document url(http://www.example.com/), domain(example.com) {
		padding: 1em;

		& .class {
			color: green;
		}
	}
}

```


